{"id":"n67029-1-10","stage":4,"title":"어설프다 · 粗糙","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67029-1-10-1","ko":"선배님, 여기 제 보고서입니다. 많이 어설프죠?","zh":"前辈，这是我的报告。做得还很生疏对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선배님,","meaning":"前辈","explanation":"선배：前辈；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66306","senseId":"1","lemma":"선배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선배님","audio":"/audio/3843029717aaaefa7507.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"보고서입니다.","meaning":"报告书","explanation":"보고서：报告书；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59656","senseId":"1","lemma":"보고서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고서입니다","audio":"/audio/8b3d47f621a8dbc5cf38.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"어설프죠?","meaning":"粗糙，不熟练","explanation":"어설프다：粗糙，不熟练；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"어설프다","audio":"/audio/332e032815011acef509.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67029","senseId":"1","lemma":"어설프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어설프죠","audio":"/audio/1fc8c85ea2b324e1ce82.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"前辈","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3","entryId":"66306","definition":"在相同领域里比自己先开始活动而经验或地位等更领先的人。","pronunciation":["선배"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"01a64adf7f150065","term":"보고서","zh":"报告书","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3","entryId":"59656","definition":"告知研究、调查内容或结果的文件或文章。","pronunciation":["보ː고서"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"332e032815011ace","term":"어설프다","zh":"粗糙，不熟练","audio":"/audio/332e032815011acef509.mp3","entryId":"67029","definition":"不熟悉，不细致而生疏。","pronunciation":["어ː설프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/592c35475c22a687b4f5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67029-1-10-2","ko":"괜찮아. 처음엔 다들 어설프지, 뭐.","zh":"没关系。刚开始的时候大家都不够熟练的，很正常的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}},{"text":"처음엔","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음엔","audio":"/audio/ad8445a13270526a3b84.mp3"}},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다들","audio":"/audio/95e0c9a40303ff931c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"어설프지,","meaning":"粗糙，不熟练","explanation":"어설프다：粗糙，不熟练；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"어설프다","audio":"/audio/332e032815011acef509.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67029","senseId":"1","lemma":"어설프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어설프지","audio":"/audio/b20b6c9e1c60e82fadd2.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","explanation":"뭐：表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"332e032815011ace","term":"어설프다","zh":"粗糙，不熟练","audio":"/audio/332e032815011acef509.mp3","entryId":"67029","definition":"不熟悉，不细致而生疏。","pronunciation":["어ː설프다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf6aa0a721a2c77129df.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWord